This column graph records students’ favourite lunchtime activities. Which graph convention is missing?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.9cm,y=0.4cm]
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,11);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(5,0);
\foreach \y in {0,2,4,6,8,10} {\draw[black] (-0.1,\y)--(0,\y);\node[black,left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.1,\y) {\y};}
\draw[black] (0.6,0) rectangle (1.4,6);
\draw[black] (2.1,0) rectangle (2.9,10);
\draw[black] (3.6,0) rectangle (4.4,4);
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (1,0) {Reading};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,0) {Sport};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (4,0) {Games};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,-1.2) {Activity};
\node[black,rotate=90,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (-1,5) {Number of students};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The graph shows how many students borrowed each type of book. Which axis label is missing, and what should it say?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.9cm,y=0.4cm]
\node[black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,12) {Books borrowed by students};
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,10);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(5,0);
\foreach \y in {0,2,4,6,8} {\draw[black] (-0.1,\y)--(0,\y);\node[black,left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-0.1,\y) {\y};}
\draw[black] (0.6,0) rectangle (1.4,8);
\draw[black] (2.1,0) rectangle (2.9,4);
\draw[black] (3.6,0) rectangle (4.4,6);
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (1,0) {Fiction};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,0) {Science};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (4,0) {History};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,-1.2) {Book type};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

This graph shows the number of seedlings planted by three classes. Which convention is missing?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.9cm,y=0.4cm]
\node[black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,11) {Seedlings planted by each class};
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,9);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(5,0);
\foreach \y in {0,2,4,6,8} {\draw[black] (-0.1,\y)--(0,\y);}
\draw[black] (0.6,0) rectangle (1.4,4);
\draw[black] (2.1,0) rectangle (2.9,8);
\draw[black] (3.6,0) rectangle (4.4,6);
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (1,0) {7A};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,0) {7B};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (4,0) {7C};
\node[black,below,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (2.5,-1.2) {Class};
\node[black,rotate=90,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] at (-0.9,4.5) {Number of seedlings};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
